Hooks are special functions provided by React that allow functional components to use React features such as:
State
Side effects
Context
References to DOM elements
Performance optimization
Sharing reusable logic

useState -> state ko manage karne ke liye

useEffect -> side effects handle karne ke liye (jaise API calls, DOM manipulation, event listener).

useContext -> global state ko consume karne ke liye without prop drilling

useReducer -> complex state management ke liye (Redux jaisa chota version)

useRef -> mutable values hold karne ke liye jo re-render trigger na karein, ya DOM access karne ke liye.

useMemo & useCallback -> optimization ke liye, unnneccessary re-render avoid karne ke liye.